  {
    "slot_number": "slot-8-1-dyn-8",
    "slot_key": "Operational escalation and fallback approval",
    "slot_value": "Require a genuine service-impacting situation for a temporary fallback only when delaying release would create a customer outage or a regulatory risk, and only if an authorized manager or operations lead approves it. It is not a routine workaround; it is an emergency exception. While in use, it must be clearly marked as temporary, time-limited, fully audited (including who approved it, when it started, and when it must be reviewed or reversed), and restricted to the specific transaction or data set that needs continuity rather than enabling broader automated updates. If using a workaround would risk masking the real problem or creating a second inconsistency later, it should not be used and the issue should remain open until the provider responds.",
