    "slot_key": "Operations console day-to-day tasks",
    "slot_value": "Review incoming provider requests, check validation results, resolve exceptions or conflicts, approve or correct records where authorized, monitor routing update and network distribution status, search transaction history, generate reports, and review audit trails when explanations are needed later. Staff should be able to use an exception queue so they do not have to hunt through routine work. Conflict resolution with clear status tracking is the next highest priority after receiving and validating provider requests, coordinating requests, activating routing changes, and distributing updated portability data.",
